      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Des flammes calcinent l’ennemi.\nS’il tient une Baie, elle est brûlée\net devient inutilisable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with fire.\nIf the target is holding a Berry, the\nBerry becomes burnt up and unusable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with fire.\nIf the target is holding a Berry, the\nBerry becomes burnt up and unusable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ほのおで　あいてを　こうげきする。\nあいてが　きのみを　もっている　とき\nもやして　つかえなく　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "불꽃으로 상대를 공격한다.\n상대가 나무열매를 지니고 있을 때\n불태워서 쓸 수 없게 만든다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Des flammes calcinent l’ennemi.\nS’il tient un objet, une Baie par exemple, celui-ci\nest brûlé et devient inutilisable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Feuer-Attacke. Trägt das Ziel eine Beere\noder ein ähnliches Item bei sich, wird dieses\nvon den Flammen verzehrt und geht verloren.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario opone resistencia y ataca a los\noponentes. También reduce su Ataque Especial.\n",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacca il nemico con una fiammata. Il fuoco\ndistruggerà le bacche o alcuni tipi di strumenti\nche il Pokémon ha con sé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks opposing Pokémon with fire.\nIf a Pokémon is holding a certain item, such as a\nBerry, the item becomes burned up and unusable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "炎で　相手を　攻撃する。\n相手が　きのみを　持っているとき\n燃やして　使えなくする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario opone resistencia y ataca a los\noponentes. También reduce su Ataque Especial.\n",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "じぶんの　からだを\nぶんまわして　あいてに\nダメージを　あたえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "자신의 몸을\n세차게 휘둘러서\n상대에게 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用自己的身體狂舞揮打，\n給予對手傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur pivote pour prendre de l’élan\net infliger des dégâts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender dreht seinen Körper und fügt dem\nZiel Schaden zu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hace pivotar su cuerpo para infligir daño al rival.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa infligge danni intorno a sé facendo\nruotare una parte del suo corpo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user swings its body around violently to inflict\ndamage on everything in its vicinity.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自分の　体を\nぶんまわして　相手に\nダメージを　与える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
