    },
    {
      "text": "ねている　あいての　ゆめを　たべて\nこうげきする。　ダメージの　はんぶんの\nＨＰを　かいふく　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "잠자고 있는 상대의 꿈을 먹어\n공격한다. 데미지의 절반을\nHP로 회복한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "吃掉熟睡中對手的夢\n進行攻擊。可以回復給予對手\n傷害的一半HP。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur mange le rêve de l’ennemi endormi\net récupère en PV la moitié des dégâts infligés.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Frisst die Träume eines schlafenden Ziels. Anwender\nwird um die Hälfte des zugefügten Schadens geheilt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Restaura al usuario la mitad del daño causado a un\nobjetivo dormido.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacco che funziona solo su un bersaglio\nche dorme. Chi lo usa riceve metà dei PS\npersi dal Pokémon colpito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user eats the dreams of a sleeping target. It\nabsorbs half the damage caused to heal its own HP.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "寝ている　相手の　夢を　食べて\n攻撃する。　ダメージの　半分の\nＨＰを　回復する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "吃掉正在睡觉的对手的梦\n进行攻击。回复对手\n所受到伤害的一半HP。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Restaura al usuario la mitad del daño causado a un\nobjetivo dormido.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "もたせた　どうぐを\nすばやく　なげつけて　こうげきする。\nどうぐで　いりょくと　こうかが　かわる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "지니게 한 도구를\n재빠르게 내던져서 공격한다.\n도구에 따라 위력과 효과가 바뀐다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "快速投擲攜帶的道具進行攻擊。\n招式威力和效果會隨著\n道具不同而改變。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur envoie l’objet qu’il tient sur l’ennemi.\nLa puissance et les effets dépendent de l’objet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender schleudert sein Item auf das Ziel. Stärke und\nEffekt der Attacke hängen vom Item ab.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario lanza contra el objetivo el objeto que lleva.\nLa fuerza del ataque y su efecto varían según el objeto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa lancia il suo strumento addosso al bersaglio.\nLa forza e l’effetto dipendono dallo strumento.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user flings its held item at the target to attack.\nThis move’s power and effects depend on the item.",
