        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "快速投掷携带的道具进行攻击。\n根据道具不同，\n威力和效果会改变。",
      "version_group": {
